  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What runs locally",
      "items": [
        "Local rules and record-based chat do not call a model. Approval creates an unpaid reservation.",
        "Clarification keeps original facts. Reset starts a fresh copy of the same pack; previous runs stay saved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Ten sponsors, disconnected",
      "items": [
        "Vercel, Supabase and n8n are prepared. Every external path needs explicit opt-in.",
        "Selected models propose; comparison advises. ElevenLabs transcribes or reads; Miro maps; Modal processes text; Port records metadata."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Authority and evidence",
      "items": [
        "Chat and transcription cannot authorise payments. Hosted execution still needs a reviewer and a separate executor.",
        "Motion illustrates topology, not live traffic. Source notes describe prepared code; provider access is unverified."
      ]
    }
